NAME     VINTAGE KODACHROME
RECIPE   Vintage Kodachrome (X-Trans III)
CREDIT   Ritchie Roesch / Fuji X Weekly
SOURCE   https://fujixweekly.com/2017/10/21/my-fujifilm-x100f-vintage-kodachrome-film-simulation-recipe/
DESC     1935-60 KODACHROME, BRONZE SKIN, CYAN SKY
NOTE     X-Trans III recipe: no Color Chrome settings; "Grain Strong" read as Strong, Large.
BASE     classicchrome.fs
WB       AUTO
SHIFT    +2 -4
DR       200
HIGHLIGHT +4
SHADOW   -2
COLOR    +4
CLARITY  0
GRAIN    STRONG LARGE
CCE      OFF
CCFXB    OFF
